<title>USA: Proactive Tech acquires Quinstone.</title>
<headline>Proactive Tech acquires Quinstone.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Proactive Technologies Inc said on Tuesday it has acquired Quinstone Industries Inc, a maker of synthetic building products in Quincy, Fla., in a stock swap.</p>
<p>Terms were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Quinstone currently has approximately $1.5 million in annual sales and should compliment Proactive's Decorete business, the company said.</p>
<p>Proactive Technologies anticipates that this acquisition, combined with Decocrete, will contribute approximately $10 million in sales annually within the next three to five years.</p>
</text>
